Two entrances, C.10 and C.11, reach every location between them - C.10's side cannot climb
back up through C.9's collapse, so the two wings are only both reachable in full once a
party has found both mouths. The loop runs C.2 - C.1 - C.7 - C.14 - C.8 - C.2, closed by
the sealed (hidden) approach between the Gatehouse and the Chamber. C.15's divide sends a
party to the Diggers' active cut or the Grave-Robbers' isolated one, and neither route
leads back to the other. C.17 forks the same way toward the Rubble Choke's dead end.

